# Release signing config for the :tv Android app. Copy to `keystore.properties`
# in this directory (the android/ Gradle root) and point it at your copy of the
# upload keystore. The real file is gitignored; NEVER commit it or the .jks.
#
# The upload key already exists (alias hexstacker-tv, RSA 2048, valid to 2126).
# Do NOT generate a new one: Play accepts only the signature the app was first
# published with, so a fresh key locks you out of updating it. Keep the .jks and
# these passwords backed up for the same reason.
#
# The values must match the ANDROID_KEYSTORE_* / ANDROID_KEY_* secrets the
# release workflow feeds this same file, or local and CI builds ship artifacts
# Play sees as different apps.
#
# storeFile must be an ABSOLUTE path, so the .jks can live outside the repo (see
# :tv's build.gradle.kts): Gradle's file() re-roots a relative path under the
# module, android/tv, not the android/ Gradle root this file sits in.
storeFile=/absolute/path/to/hexstacker.keystore.jks
storePassword=CHANGEME
keyAlias=hexstacker-tv
keyPassword=CHANGEME
